{
  "version": 1,
  "comment": "Declarative layout of the kit harness into a consumer (idea: teamai ResourceHandler table). Engine: tools/kit-layout/kit_layout.py. Paths are consumer-relative; 'harness/' prefix = inside the kit submodule (HARNESS_REL).",
